## 九、测试清单（关键用例）

### tests/versions/

| 用例 | 断言 |
|------|------|
| test_state_machine_all_transitions | 6 态全部可达 |
| test_no_overwrite_frozen | 已冻结版本不可原地修改 |
| test_derivation_parent_id | 派生版本 parent_version_id 正确 |
| test_optimistic_lock | 并发更新同一版本 → 409 |
| test_artifacts_sha256 | plan/hocon/quality_contract SHA256 稳定 |
| test_diff_versions | 两版本 Schema/HOCON/质量规则差异 |
| test_router_freeze | API-07 冻结 + 返回 SHA256 |

### tests/harness/（AC-01 / AC-05 核心）

| 用例 | 断言 |
|------|------|
| test_pdp_9_rules | 9 条规则全注册；聚合逻辑正确 |
| test_pdp_deny_no_approval | DENY 清空审批要求 |
| test_pdp_cross_project_deny | 跨项目 → HARNESS-P0-CROSS-PROJECT / DENY |
| test_policy_package_verify | 签名验签通过 |
| test_policy_package_tamper | 篡改 → 启动拒绝 |
| test_prepare_fingerprint_stable | 同输入 → 同指纹 |
| test_prepare_idempotent | 同 idempotency_key 返回同一准备单 |
| test_prepare_deny_returns_403 | PDP DENY → 403，无准备单落库 |
| **test_four_eyes_self_approval** | **申请人自批 → HARNESS_409_SELF_APPROVAL（AC-01）** |
| **test_four_eyes_role_taken** | **同角色二次审批 → HARNESS_409_ROLE_TAKEN（AC-01）** |
| **test_four_eyes_p0_requires_two** | **P0 场景 required_approvals=2，一人通过不足以 READY（AC-01）** |
| test_four_eyes_role_required | 无 Harness 职责 → AUTH_403_ROLE_REQUIRED |
| test_approval_evidence_sha256 | 决策带 evidence_sha256 落库 |
| **test_commit_reverify_fingerprint** | **指纹被篡改 → Commit 拒绝（AC-05）** |
| **test_commit_insufficient_approval** | **审批不足 → HARNESS_409_APPROVAL_INSUFFICIENT（AC-05）** |
| **test_commit_signs_capability** | **签发 Ed25519 单次 Capability，TTL ≤300s（AC-05）** |
| **test_commit_atomic_outbox** | **同事务创建 ExecutionRun + Outbox（AC-05）** |
| test_commit_already_committed | 重复 Commit → 409 |
| **test_capability_replay_guard** | **同一令牌第二次消费 → HARNESS_409_CAPABILITY_REPLAYED（AC-05）** |
| test_capability_expired | 过期令牌 → HARNESS_401_CAPABILITY_EXPIRED |
| test_capability_claims_binding | claims 绑定 tool/subject/environment/artifact 指纹等 |
| test_tool_broker_registry_only | Agent 自报的副作用不在注册清单 → 拒绝 |
| test_side_effects_9_registered | 9 类副作用全注册 |
| test_outbox_pending_written | Commit 后 Outbox 有 PENDING 行 |
| test_lease_mutex | 同一准备单并发执行 → 只有一个租约 |
| test_zero_plaintext_harness_responses | 所有 Harness 响应无凭证明文 |

## 十、验收命令（DoD 必须附输出）

```powershell
cd D:\Desktop\code\etl_agent

# 1. 前置检查
git log --oneline -3
docker compose -f infra\docker-compose.yml ps

# 2. 同步依赖
uv sync --extra dev

# 3. 迁移（S6 不新增；S1 的 8 张 M6 表应在）
uv run alembic upgrade head
uv run alembic downgrade base
uv run alembic upgrade head

# 4. 生成策略包（首次）
uv run python scripts\gen_policy_package.py

# 5. 单元测试
uv run pytest tests\versions\ tests\harness\ -v
uv run pytest tests -q   # 全量回归

# 6. Lint / Type
uv run ruff check src\ tests\
uv run mypy src\etl_agent\versions\ src\etl_agent\harness\ src\etl_agent\config.py

# 7. 凭据零明文
Get-ChildItem -Recurse -File -Include "*.py","*.yml","*.yaml","*.ini","*.sql","*.toml" |
  Where-Object { $_.FullName -notmatch "\\\.git\\|\\\.venv\\" } |
  Select-String -Pattern "(password|secret|token)\s*=\s*['\`"][^'\`"]{3,}['\`"]"

# 8. AC-01 专项：四眼职责分离
uv run pytest tests\harness\test_four_eyes.py -v

# 9. AC-05 专项：三阶段协议 + 单次令牌 + 防重放
uv run pytest tests\harness\test_commit.py tests\harness\test_capability.py tests\harness\test_replay_guard.py -v

# 10. 代码注释抽检
Get-ChildItem -Recurse -File -Path src\etl_agent\ -Include "*.py" |
  Where-Object { $_.Name -ne "__init__.py" } |
  ForEach-Object {
    $head = Get-Content $_.FullName -TotalCount 10 -Raw
    if ($head -notmatch "SPEC 依据" -or $head -notmatch "覆盖 FR" -or $head -notmatch "对应 AC") {
      Write-Output "MISSING HEADER: $($_.FullName)"
    }
  }

# 11. .env 未被修改
Get-Content infra\.env | Select-String "HARNESS_SIGNING_KEY_HEX|HARNESS_PUBLIC_KEYS|FERNET_KEY"
# 期望：均为人类配置的值，未被 S6 修改
```

